-Uhn!

234
00:18:54,091 --> 00:18:56,551
-Are you scared, Bobby?
-We were scared, Bobby.

235
00:18:56,719 --> 00:18:59,721
-When the monster came for us.
-And grabbed us tight.

236
00:18:59,889 --> 00:19:02,891
